# lockra
===
 Two-factor codes and passwords on your computers and your phone, encrypted and in sync: a TOTP/HOTP authenticator and password manager for Windows, macOS, Linux and Android (iOS planned), with a browser extension for Chrome, Edge and Firefox, end-to-end encrypted sync, and import/export for Google Authenticator and Microsoft Authenticator.
